# Design Documents

Welcome to the VaagBanda design documentation repository. This directory contains comprehensive design specifications and architectural documentation for the VaagBanda Software Engineering project.

## Overview

VaagBanda is a web-based application built with HTML, JavaScript, and CSS. This folder contains all design documents that outline the system architecture, database design, UI/UX specifications, and technical requirements.

## Documentation Index

### Physical Design Specification
- **[VaagBanda Physical Design Specification V1](https://view.officeapps.live.com/op/view.aspx?src=raw.githubusercontent.com/asim-stha/VaagBanda/main/design/DESIGN%20DOCUMENTS/VaagBanda_Physical_Design_Specification_V1.xlsx)** - Latest design specification document
  - Database schema and design
  - Physical data model
  - Technical architecture details
                                        
## Project Stack

This project is composed of:
- **HTML**: 78.5% - Frontend markup
- **JavaScript**: 10.8% - Client-side logic
- **CSS**: 10.7% - Styling and layout

## How to Use These Documents

1. **For New Team Members**: Start with the Physical Design Specification to understand the system architecture
2. **For Developers**: Reference these documents when implementing features to ensure consistency with the design
3. **For Design Review**: Use these documents as the source of truth for design decisions and specifications

## Document Status

| Document | Version | Last Updated | Status |
|----------|---------|--------------|--------|
| Physical Design Specification | V1 | - | Current |

## Contributing

When making updates to the design:
1. Keep documentation in sync with implementation changes
2. Update version numbers when significant changes are made
3. Document the rationale behind architectural decisions
4. Include diagrams and visual aids where helpful

## Questions or Issues?

If you have questions about the design or find outdated information, please open an issue in the repository.

